# Active Directory Lab

## Overview
This project is a basic Active Directory lab built using Windows Server in a virtual environment. It was created to practice IT support and Windows Server administration skills.

## What I did
- Installed and configured Active Directory Domain Services (AD DS)
- Set up DNS on Windows Server
- Created domain users and groups
- Configured basic domain environment

## Tools Used
- Windows Server (Virtual Machine)
- Oracle VirtualBox / VMware
- Active Directory Users and Computers (ADUC)

